# L §5.11: "Within one def, the reads on one index all go one way; reads both ways are LOAD-CYCLE."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

index ks = 1..3
input step: int

def x[k in ks]: int at reader
  rule base = step
  rule a beats base = x[k - 1] when pos(k) > 1
  rule b beats base = x[k + 1] when pos(k) == 1
=== expect
refused: LOAD-CYCLE ...
